---
/*
 * /home/ used to be the home page, and / used to redirect to the
 * privacy policy.
 *
 * Now the home page is at /, and /home/ redirects there. The redirect
 * is permanent because the old arrangement is not coming back, and
 * anything that still points at /home/ (an old bookmark, a link in an
 * app store listing, a search engine) should end up at the home page
 * rather than at a 404.
 */
return Astro.redirect("/", 301);
---
